+# Textbook-to-companion handoff - 2.1.1 Kostenstructuren
+
+## 1. Identity
+
+- Paragraph: §2.1.1, Book 2, Chapter 2.1 Kosten en opbrengsten; 4vwo.
+- Lesson path: `Boek 2 - Kosten, opbrengsten, elasticiteit en surplus/2.1 Hoofdstuk Kosten en opbrengsten/2.1.1 Kostenstructuren`.
+- Paired branches: `codex/assessment-paragraph-20260913`; owner `assessment-paragraph`.
+- Platform baseline: `85b0f347f3070e005eae3f35f0b11ce6eac71b4d`; unchanged platform source/tooling.
+- Lesson baseline: `0acaaa97443e5c4fee34f7da8a12ccd5db62d762`. New local commit, when made, is recorded in assessment `completion.md`; review binds the content manifest instead of a circular future commit hash.
